DEFINE sets = ["Set 1", "Set 2", "Set 3"]
DEFINE score_thresholds for each set

FOR each set in sets:

    LOAD all images in the set

    FOR each image:

        READ image

        IF image is invalid:
            SKIP

        GET image width and height

        -------------------------
        STEP 1: REGION OF INTEREST
        -------------------------
        EXTRACT horizontal strip around y_center

        -------------------------
        STEP 2: PREPROCESSING
        -------------------------
        CONVERT ROI to grayscale
        APPLY Gaussian blur to reduce noise

        -------------------------
        STEP 3: EDGE DETECTION
        -------------------------
        APPLY Sobel filter in x-direction
        AVERAGE vertically → convert to 1D signal

        -------------------------
        STEP 4: FIND EDGE PAIRS
        -------------------------
        INITIALISE best_score = 0
        INITIALISE best_pair = NONE

        FOR each position i across width:

            IF gradient at i is strongly negative:
                (candidate left edge)

                FOR positions j to the right of i:

                    IF gradient at j is strongly positive:
                        (candidate right edge)

                        COMPUTE gap_width = j - i

                        IF gap_width is within expected range:

                            COMPUTE score =
                                |gradient at i| + |gradient at j|

                            IF score > best_score:
                                UPDATE best_score
                                STORE pair (i, j)

        -------------------------
        STEP 5: VALIDATE DETECTION
        -------------------------
        GET threshold for current set

        IF best_pair exists AND best_score > threshold:
            COMPUTE weld gap center position
            SET valid = 1
        ELSE:
            SET position = -1
            SET valid = 0

        -------------------------
        STEP 6: VISUALISATION
        -------------------------
        IF valid:
            DRAW vertical line at detected position

        GENERATE Sobel profile image for debugging

        -------------------------
        STEP 7: SAVE RESULTS
        -------------------------
        SAVE visualisation images
        STORE (image name, position, validity)

    -------------------------
    STEP 8: EXPORT CSV
    -------------------------
    WRITE all results to CSV file

PRINT "All sets processed"
